cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Plug Map's data or software, please cite it as below and say
  which data snapshot you used (the date shown on the site, from
  data/snapshots.json).
type: dataset
title: "Plug Map: which open-source sustainability tools share data formats"
abstract: >-
  Plug Map goes through the OpenSustain.tech catalog one category at a time
  and records which data formats, protocols, standards, data sources and code
  ecosystems each tool reads, writes, speaks or pulls. Every record is a claim
  with evidence: the file and line of code, the dependency it declares, or the
  README sentence it came from, pinned to a commit.
authors:
  - alias: AbdulSalam416
    website: "https://github.com/AbdulSalam416"
version: 0.2.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://plug-map.onrender.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbdulSalam416/plug-map"
keywords:
  - open source
  - sustainability
  - climate
  - energy systems
  - interoperability
  - data formats
  - research software
